#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-AD0687 expect=noViolation domain=ADDL
#library standard=adamig version=1-3
#note "Negative control mirroring CDISC-AD0687-valid-ADDL: DEVIPDT (21915) is less than DEVXPDT (22281), so the rule must stay silent. expect=noViolation additionally asserts the rule EXECUTED, so this cannot pass by being out of scope; the -invalid- twin is the positive control against passing vacuously. NOTE this fixture was green BOTH before and after the value_is_reference fix - a rule that can never fire is silent here too - so it proves nothing on its own and only the -invalid- twin pins the defect."
dataset ADDL
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col SPDEVID type=Char
col DEVIPDT type=Num
col DEVXPDT type=Num
